&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusfNqhiw0W4q7eidpL36ogjg&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in the design and optimization of the MasterCard/VISA card issuance business system to improve system performance and development efficiency, ensuring high availability, maintainability, and scalability of the system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusUJ7zvKWt8f7f1zqbGb83vb&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Involved in the design and implementation of multiple subsystems in card issuance business, including card application, card management, reconciliation, etc., ensuring clear boundaries between modules for easy expansion to support rapid business growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusG2uUOJGc6reXOeqD2Fezhc&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
