&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuse72TAykpNVkxq5ZDDqCSmf&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Responsible for stability construction, ensuring high stability of card application and card management; guaranteeing the performance and accuracy of card transaction reconciliation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
