&lt;div&gt;Solid foundation in Java programming, mastery of common design patterns, and multithreading programming; familiar with common Java open-source frameworks (Spring/Spring Boot, Mybatis).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussHasrqGvNlwR5pLegnXZCe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
