&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussHasrqGvNlwR5pLegnXZCe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Practical experience in developing highly available applications based on databases, caches, message middleware, and microservices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussHasrqGvNlwR5pLegnXZCe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
