&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I3fmdZuJFoTBq5x36pAufcDSstf&quot;&gt;OKX is committed to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, genetic information, creed, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, lawful alien status, national origin, age, marital status, and non-job related physical or mental disability, or protected veteran status. Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/div&gt;
